      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just so I understand the implications of this -- what happens if we need to create a resource in Gpu somewhere, e.g., a Buffer for transfers? It looks like Caps is also on the Recorder -- should Gpu still have Caps? It also doesn\u0027t look Context does much of anything anymore other than be a wrapper around Gpu and hold Recordings.\n\nI don\u0027t have a problem with any of it (except maybe not being able to create resources for the backend without a Recorder) I\u0027m just trying to figure out how it all will work.",
      "revId": "7f72329614a2ffbcb2ad5bb2bc7981c1c4009c38",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b0837715_c9eb5819",
